::error file=domain/entities.go,line=12,col=2,title=E004 nullable PostgreSQL column cannot be represented by the Go field::nullable column public.users.nickname cannot be represented by string%0A%0Astring has no value that means SQL NULL%0A%0AFix: use *string, or sql.Null[string]
::error file=domain/entities.go,line=17,col=2,title=E004 nullable PostgreSQL column cannot be represented by the Go field::nullable column public.users.tags cannot be represented by []string%0A%0Aa slice cannot distinguish SQL NULL from an empty array: both arrive as a nil or empty slice%0A%0AFix: use *[]string
